---
import IntegrationLogo from './IntegrationLogo.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import FAQ from './FAQ.astro';
import CTA from './CTA.astro';
import integrations from '../data/integrations.json';
interface Props {integration:typeof integrations[number]}
const {integration:i}=Astro.props;
---
<section class="integration-detail-hero wrap"><div><div class="integration-detail-label"><span class="catalog-logo"><IntegrationLogo slug={i.slug} size={30}/></span><span class="eyebrow">TRACEGATE + {i.name}</span></div><h1>{i.headline}</h1><p>{i.description}</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Explore a walkthrough<Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={17}/></a><a class="text-link" href="/integrations/">All integrations<Icon name="arrow-right" size={16}/></a></div></div><div class="integration-exchange"><div class="exchange-heading"><span class="meta">{i.type.toUpperCase()} CONTEXT</span><span class="review-label">Integration concept</span></div><div class="exchange-brands"><span class="exchange-source"><IntegrationLogo slug={i.slug} size={40}/></span><div class="exchange-signal" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div><span class="exchange-tracegate"><img src="/brand/tracegate-mark.svg" alt="Tracegate" width="42" height="42"/></span></div><div class="exchange-objects">{i.objects.map((object,index)=><div><span class="meta">0{index+1}</span><span>{object}</span><Icon name="check" size={15}/></div>)}</div><p>Evidence in context. A decision your team can explain.</p></div></section>
<section class="integration-features section wrap"><div class="section-header"><span class="eyebrow">WHAT THE CONNECTION BRINGS</span><h2>More context.<br/>A clearer next step.</h2></div><div class="integration-feature-grid">{i.features.map((feature,index)=><article class="reveal"><span class="meta">0{index+1}</span><h3>{feature.title}</h3><p>{feature.description}</p></article>)}</div></section><section class="integration-flow-section"><div class="wrap section"><div class="section-header"><h2>Keep the handoff connected.</h2><p>A proposed information flow for {i.name}. Every example is illustrative.</p></div><div class="integration-flow">{i.route.map((label,index)=><><div><span class="product-symbol"><Icon name={['cloud','route','users'][index]} size={28}/></span><strong>{label}</strong><span class="meta">0{index+1}</span></div>{index<2&&<span class="integration-flow-line" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-right" size={19}/></span>}</>)}</div></div></section><section class="detail-editorial wrap"><div><span class="eyebrow">A DELIBERATE CONNECTION</span><h2>Scope first.<br/>Then connect.</h2><p>{i.boundary}</p></div><div class="integration-checklist">{i.steps.map((step,index)=><div><span class="meta">0{index+1}</span><strong>{step}</strong><Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={17}/></div>)}<p>A production connector would need documented permissions and data handling. The demo does not request credentials or initiate a connection.</p></div></section><FAQ items={i.faq}/><section class="section wrap"><div class="journal-heading"><h2>Part of your wider stack.</h2><a class="text-link" href="/integrations/">Browse all integrations<Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={17}/></a></div><div class="integration-related">{integrations.filter(item=>item.slug!==i.slug).sort((a,b)=>Number(b.type===i.type)-Number(a.type===i.type)).slice(0,3).map(item=><a href={`/integrations/${item.slug}/`}><IntegrationLogo slug={item.slug} size={28}/><strong>{item.name}</strong><Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={17}/></a>)}</div></section><CTA title="Give the connection a purpose." description="Explore how the Tracegate concept brings cloud, identity, and workflow context into one review."/>
